// bootstrap: solver_core — 求解器核心: Newton-Raphson+梯度下降

Point solver_core:
  newton_raphson(f, df, x0, tol, max_iter) -> Point
  gradient_descent(loss, grad, lr, epochs) -> Point
  line_search(f, direction, step, c) -> float

Constraint solver_core:
  newton_raphson: |f(x_n)| < tol at convergence
  gradient_descent: loss decreases monotonically
  line_search satisfies Wolfe conditions

Prove;
Normalize;
